            "review_title": "Review at Miên Saigon",
            "review_text": "Hwee C\n10 contributions\n0\nRestaurant's favorite review\nVietnamese cuisine Fine dining\nJan 2026 • Solo\nVietnamese fine dining. A truly unique restaurant. Using local ingredients to blend mouth watering flavour to fine dining quality. It shows what perceived to be low price ingredients (without any disrespect) can be turned into a remarkable art. A different angle of embracing the wisdom of Vietnamese cuisine.\nWritten January 31, 2026\nMiên Sài Gòn\nThank you for your thoughtful review. We’re so pleased you enjoyed our unique approach to Vietnamese fine dining and our way of elevating local ingredients with care and creativity.\n\nYour kind words mean a lot to us, and we look forward to welcoming you again.\nRead more\nWritten April 21, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
